## Tooling

The following rules are enforced mechanically:

- `.githooks/commit-msg` checks commit messages against `docs/reference/repo-conventions.md`.
- `.claude/settings.json` asks before every git commit and git push, and denies reading `.env` files and `secrets/`.
- `.claude/settings.json` denies Claude edits to itself, `.claude/harness.json` and `.githooks/`. Change them by hand.
{% if commit_gate %}- The harness plugin blocks a Claude commit until `/harness:prepare-commit` has run for exactly the staged changes (`.claude/harness.json`).
{% endif %}
The harness plugin (`harness@{{ marketplace_name }}`) provides the skills and
hooks. This file and `.claude/settings.json` come from the scaffold: update
them with `copier update`.
